    {
      "id": "seg:paragraph:discussion:0010:0001",
      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0010",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "When you create a noise map from a [`GKNoise`](gknoise.md) object, GameplayKit performs the noise generation and processing computations necessary to fill a discrete grid with noise samples.",
      "normalizedSource": "When you create a noise map from a [`GKNoise`](gknoise.md) object, GameplayKit performs the noise generation and processing computations necessary to fill a discrete grid with noise samples.",
